'''On the Day We Meet Again''' (Korean: '''다시 만나는 날엔''' ''Dasi Mannaneun Naren'') is the ending theme for the Korean dub of ''[[M16|Genesect and the Legend Awakened]]''. It is performed by Hyesu.

